 "instructions": "binnacle: a Raspberry Pi 5 development workstation. Paths live under ~/Projects and /tmp. list_files (browse or glob), search_text (regex over contents), read_file, edit_file (exact-string replace), write_file (whole file), run_command (shell; long commands become jobs for job_status/stop_job). Pi hardware and health: run_command (vcgencmd, pinctrl, i2cdetect, libcamera-still).",
 "tools": [
